Estamos virando picolé aqui.

1074
01:26:49,992 --> 01:26:51,388
Vão embora!

1075
01:26:51,389 --> 01:26:52,689
Elliot?

1076
01:26:53,050 --> 01:26:54,497
Vão embora!

1077
01:26:54,498 --> 01:26:56,449
