1085
01:27:09,852 --> 01:27:11,222
Abra a porta, cara.
Qual é.

1086
01:27:11,223 --> 01:27:13,211
- Saiam.
- Elliot!

1087
01:27:13,212 --> 01:27:14,523
Bye...

1088
01:27:20,748 --> 01:27:22,317
Não!

1089
01:27:22,318 --> 01:27:24,078
Elliot, que diabos
